<title>USA: CSCE to decrease margins on cocoa futures May 28.</title>
<headline>CSCE to decrease margins on cocoa futures May 28.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Coffee, Sugar and Cocoa Exchange said Tuesday it will decrease margins on all cocoa contracts by $100 to $500, effective May 28.</p>
<p>For customers who are not exchange members or a member of the trade, margins will be 140 percent above trade rates, the excange said in a statement. ((--Patricia Avidan, New York Commodities Desk, 212 859 1640))</p>
